WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.080
Another thing Dr. Bright is not&nbsp;
allowed to do at the Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:07.100
Dr. Bright! Clockwork Virus&nbsp;
victims are not The Borg!

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:12.440
Victims of SCP-217 bear no resemblance to&nbsp;
real-life versions of Star Trek villains.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:16.400
They're going through a lot as it is, and&nbsp;
they don't need you trying to destroy them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.380
with lasers while yelling "The Borg have&nbsp;
attacked!" Show some compassion, man.

